  "testId": "testim-migrated/tests/webstore/checkout/verify-simple-product-checkout-page-coupon-and-voucher-code-functionality-for-guest-user.spec.ts > Webstore - Checkout > verify simple product checkout page coupon and voucher code functionality for guest user",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "A guest adds a simple product at quantity 5, checks out as guest with the flat-rate shipping method, applies a voucher and checks the voucher labels and that order total minus voucher equals Amount To Be Paid, removes it, applies an Amount Off Order coupon and checks the order-total reconciliation, then fills the cart name and additional information. No order is placed.",
    "steps": [
      "Guest: add simpleProduct at quantity productQuantity, open the cart and check out as guest",
      "Check the Proceed to Checkout heading, fill the guest address, select the flat-rate shipping method and remove any pre-applied voucher",
      "Apply voucherNumber: voucher number, Voucher Amount and Amount To Be Paid labels; order total - voucher amount = amount to be paid (0.05 tolerance); remove the voucher",
      "Apply coupon: success message, discount line and Handling Charges label; subtotal + shipping + handling + tax - discount - shipping discount = order total (0.05 tolerance)",
      "Fill the cart name (projectName) and additional information"
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "product",
      "voucher",
      "promotion",
      "shipping",
      "cart"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [
      "Guest cart: product added, voucher applied then removed, coupon applied (left applied)",
      "No order is placed, so neither the voucher balance nor a coupon redemption is consumed"
    ],
    "assertions": [
      "Proceed to Checkout heading (soft)",
      "Applied voucher number equals voucherNumber; Voucher Amount and Amount To Be Paid labels",
      "Order total - voucher amount - amount to be paid within 0.05",
      "Coupon message equals couponSuccessMessage; discount visible; Handling Charges label",
      "Order-summary reconciliation within 0.05"
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Title matches the flow (guest, simple product, coupon and voucher at checkout); comments refer to lines of the Testim export",
      "Store MaxwellsHardware: the store every atstage webstore spec runs on (same as the approved shopping-cart and PDP entries); not named in the scan.",
      "Profile (atstage, generated 2026-10-31T17:34) has no observations for this spec (scanned 2026-11-01): every source is profiled false.",
      "Guest address values (masked) are typed by the test: role config, never customer data.",
      "checkoutPage.selectShippingMethod clicks Ship Complete and then lblShippingMethodFLAT (Custom Flat Rate): SHIPPING_FLAT_RATE_ON_STORE with shippingCode FLAT; destination country assumed 'us'; assumption.",
      "simpleProduct at productQuantity 5: PRODUCT_SIMPLE_IN_STOCK quantityUsed 5, minMaxQuantity 5. z-1002656 also appears in a spec comment (export reference), not in code.",
      "coupon TESTGUEST (live, read-only: promotion Testim_CheckoutPageGuestUserCoupon, Amount Off Order, Discount 10, OrderMinimum 10, no profile, store PortalId 7, AvailableQuantity 100): COUPON_AMOUNT_OFF_ORDER discountAmount 10 (the amount is not asserted, only the discount line and the reconciliation), allProfiles true, single coupon so allowedWithOtherCoupons false, redemptionsNeeded 1 (no order placed).",
      "Re-mapped (voucher keys 2026-11-01): voucherNumber O7OQDDGOXX -> need voucher (VOUCHER_UNRESTRICTED), output voucherNumber, preferred (the test's own voucher first); read-only: applied and removed, no order placed with it",
      "projectName and additionalInformation are free text the test types: config.",
      "swap: data only through loadData (simpleProduct -> product.sku, voucherNumber -> voucher.voucherNumber, coupon -> coupon.couponCode), assertions are labels and arithmetic over values read on the page, no data value in the spec code, no other data file."
    ],
    "confidence": "low",
    "needsReview": true
  },
